Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), shellcheck
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/cfpandrade/adtool
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: adtool
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, coreutils, krb5-user, ldap-utils, libc-bin, python3, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Active Directory command-line client using Kerberos
 Query and administer Active Directory using an existing Kerberos ticket.
 Results are rendered as readable tables, CSV, or JSON, while account writes
 use a sealed GSSAPI session.
